  "description": "*“Here, fantasy becomes reality—if you can survive.”*\n\nWhile searching for his missing daughter, a man arrives at a bizarre amusement park, where a monster in a teddy bear costume tells him he must survive the park’s deadly games if he wants to find her. Forty other participants have been drawn there by promises of money, fame, and their deepest desires—but who will survive long enough to claim what they came for?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
